      "message": "minor suggestion, you can ignore) If new entry(s) are added, calculated `entry_size` and actual entry size would mismatch.  `body_offset` is still useful, though.\n\nCan we rename `body_offset` and/or remove check around it? technically we can only know the location of known places with entry, and we don\u0027t know rest of area.",
